205
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:41,140
The recreational boats were about 234 feet long by 70 feet wide.

206
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,940
They had a radiant heating system

207
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:46,140
that employed slaves using bellows to pump hot air

208
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:50,340
